msgctxt "76"
msgid "Daddy! What did you get us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Tadaaa! Six-scoop ice cream cones!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Whoa! You're the best, Dad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Daddy does love to spoil his little treasures.\r\n"
"And who's this gentleman?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"There was too much ice cream for me to carry on my own, so this nice man "
"helped me to bring it here. Thank you, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Don't mention it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Yes, thank you very much! There must be something we can do to repay your "
"kindness..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Oh, I know! Why don't you take this cone for yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Yes, it's fine. My husband and I can share one. Right, honey?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Absolutely! Sharing an ice cream cone with my wife... Gosh, it reminds me "
"of when we were just schoolkids on a date."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"See? I told you he wouldn't mind.\r\n"
"Here you go! It's all yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "All right, if you say so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Six-Scoop Ice Cream<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Thanks for helping my daddy, mister! This ice cream tastes really yummy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Now, how about we take this ice cream and head downtown for some "
"sightseeing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "(Looks like they're enjoying their vacation. Glad I could lend a hand.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

